tary perfect number if it is the sum of its proper unitary divisors. -/\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:33:def IsUnitaryPerfect (n : ℕ) : Prop :=\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:34:  ∑ i ∈ properUnitaryDivisors n, i = n ∧ 0 < n\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:37:Are there only finitely many unitary perfect numbers? -/\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:39:theorem erdos_1052 :\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:40:    answer(sorry) ↔ {n | IsUnitaryPerfect n}.Finite := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:44:All unitary perfect numbers are even.\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:48:@[category research solved, AMS 11, formal_proof using formal_conjectures at \"https://github.com/mzhorvath1/formal-conjectures/blob/b70a2ddf5e55f743aac9d4f4a907786b39bc9807/FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean#L46\"]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:49:theorem even_of_isUnitaryPerfect (n : ℕ) (hn : IsUnitaryPerfect n) : Even n := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:53:theorem isUnitaryPerfect_6 : IsUnitaryPerfect 6 := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:54:  norm_num [IsUnitaryPerfect, properUnitaryDivisors]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:58:theorem isUnitaryPerfect_60 : IsUnitaryPerfect 60 := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:59:  norm_num [IsUnitaryPerfect, properUnitaryDivisors]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:63:theorem isUnitaryPerfect_90 : IsUnitaryPerfect 90 := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:64:  norm_num [IsUnitaryPerfect, properUnitaryDivisors]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:68:theorem isUnitaryPerfect_87360 : IsUnitaryPerfect 87360 := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:71:  norm_num [IsUnitaryPerfect, properUnitaryDivisors]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:74:@[category test, AMS 11, formal_proof using formal_conjectures at \"https://github.com/Sanexxxx777/formal-conjectures/blob/be8aed15e8888a08bbe723170698e26c046412a4/FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean#L346\"]\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:75:theorem isUnitaryPerfect_146361946186458562560000 : IsUnitaryPerfect 146361946186458562560000 := by\n./FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/1052.lean:78:end Erdos1052\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
